---
title: SecureCapita - Password Reset Flow
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant RP as Angular ResetPasswordComponent
    participant API as UserController (/user)
    participant SVC as UserService
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant MAIL as SMTP Mail
    participant VC as Angular VerifyComponent

    U->>RP: Enter account email
    RP->>API: GET /user/resetpassword/{email}
    API->>SVC: resetPassword(email)
    SVC->>DB: insert resetpasswordverifications<br/>(url key + expiration_date)
    SVC->>MAIL: send reset email<br/>(/user/verify/password/{key})
    API-->>RP: 200 OK (email sent)

    U->>MAIL: Open email, click reset link
    U->>VC: GET /user/verify/password/{key}
    VC->>API: GET /user/verify/password/{key}
    API->>SVC: verifyPasswordKey(key)
    SVC->>DB: validate key not expired
    API-->>VC: 200 OK (key valid, show form)

    U->>VC: Enter new password + confirm
    VC->>API: PUT /user/new/password
    API->>SVC: renewPassword(key, password, confirm)
    SVC->>DB: update users.password (bcrypt)
    SVC->>DB: delete resetpasswordverifications row
    API-->>VC: 200 OK (password updated)
    VC-->>U: Redirect to /login
